			"notes": "I've made a new mod! Leadlight adds Window Frames that can be filled with glass to make different patterns.\n\n### Known Issues\n\n- Transparent blocks (like Water) are invisible when behind filled Window Frames when Improved Transparency is off.\n  - This is fixed when turning on Improved Transparency in the video settings.\n\n### Added\n\n- Iron Window Frames\n  - Comes in 6 shapes: Large, Horizontal, Vertical, Square, Cross, and Diamond.\n  - Craft a Large frame with 8 Iron Nuggets in a ring.\n  - Craft the other shapes with a Large frame and more Iron Nuggets in different shapes.\n  - Use Cut Stained Glass Panes to a space in the frame, use an empty hand to empty a space.\n- Cut Stained Glass Panes\n  - Crafted using Stained Glass Panes in a Stonecutter."
		},
